  "description": "Crafted for life’s everyday adventures, the U2 Pro seamlessly blends power and practicality.\nIts 810W peak motor quietly tackles steep hills and grocery-laden trips, supporting up to 265lbs of life’s essentials—whether your grandchild, a week’s groceries, or your cute puppy in a carrier. U2 Pro, built with 16×4-inch fat tires and rear suspension, can smooth and carry over cracked sidewalks and gravel paths. Need to run errands? The 34-mile range handles school pickups, pharmacy stops, and park visits on a single charge, and with dual brakes that respond like a trusted friend’s reminder, safety stays priority number one. No apps, no fuss—just a sturdy U-shaped deck for your bags, a comfy seat for your journey, and the freedom to focus on what matters.",
